---
/**
 * Preview-only banner.
 *
 * The catalogue currently shows placeholder models with borrowed CC-licensed
 * photos. Without this, the shop owner sees a real reference number next to a
 * photo of a different watch and concludes the site is broken rather than
 * unfinished.
 *
 * DELETE THIS COMPONENT (and its use in Base.astro) when real products and
 * real photography land. It is not part of the finished site.
 */
---

<div class="border-b border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-6 py-3 text-center">
  <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-sm text-ink">
    <span class="inline-block h-3 w-1 align-middle bg-accent"></span>
    این نسخه‌ی نمونه است. ساعت‌ها و عکس‌ها واقعی نیستند و فقط برای نشان دادن طراحی سایت
    گذاشته شده‌اند. مدل‌های واقعی مغازه بعدا جایگزین می‌شوند.
  </p>
</div>
